            "text": "A manager calls with an upset resident beside them. The resident wants a free release and says an attorney will be involved. You may feel pressure to defend the company or agree quickly. Start by organizing the situation.\n\nYour role is to help people understand the facts and the next step. A calm first response can be: **“I understand you need a clear answer. Let’s confirm the vehicle and work through the timeline so the right person can review it.”**"
